          <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:0.9rem;color:#111311;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">{trainer.name} hasn't added a bio yet</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.82rem;color:#8a8f8a;line-height:1.6;">Check back soon — their story and training approach will appear here.</div>
